WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:03.830
Sometimes when you reach me, I pretend to
fall asleep. So you'll go.

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:06.710
I want to make a toast.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:07.700
Oh, any excuse.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:09.920
To my brilliant daughter.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.120
So not you.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:12.560
Oh. Oh. Oh, God.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:13.250
It hurts.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:14.270
Gosh, you cut yourself.

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:16.190
Don't get blood on my eggs.

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:18.890
Okay, That's good. I can feel that working.

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:20.210
I can finally breathe.

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:20.220
Ohhh.

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:23.450
I can't hear myself think.

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.380
Hey, sweetie. Hi. How was your day?

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:29.240
Better than hers. What's wrong now?

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:30.920
Daddy's just having a moment.

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:33.140
He's always having a moment.

